# Water: three harbour scenes filmed twice, OpenGothic as it was and our water physics on.
# Each setup restores the features it needs; the off take disables all six afterwards.
# Actions use real spells, native death and falling items in both takes. No AI server.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
view full
ui off
noise on

# body: a farmer killed by the wind fist beside the low harbour pier
ragdoll on
living on
spell feature on
movable on
destruction on
water on
water-film setup body
off: ragdoll off
off: living off
off: spell feature off
off: movable off
off: destruction off
off: water off
spell equip 26
wait 1200
rec body
water-film begin
spell cast 600
wait 6000
water-film checkpoint
wait 2500
stop

# fireball: newly inserted crate and barrel on dry support at the water's edge
ragdoll on
living on
spell feature on
movable on
destruction on
water on
water-film setup fireball
off: ragdoll off
off: living off
off: spell feature off
off: movable off
off: destruction off
off: water off
spell equip 23
wait 1200
rec fireball
water-film begin
spell cast 600
wait 6000
water-film checkpoint
wait 2500
stop

# things: a sword, ore, lute and arrow fall together over deep water
ragdoll on
living on
spell feature on
movable on
destruction on
water on
water-film setup things
off: ragdoll off
off: living off
off: spell feature off
off: movable off
off: destruction off
off: water off
wait 600
rec things
water-film begin
wait 6000
water-film checkpoint
wait 4500
stop
